    "title": "Beyond fraud detection: Why dispute management needs an overhaul",
    "summary": "Post-incident fraud management needs to adapt. But how?",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.finextra.com/event-info/643/beyond-fraud-detection-why-dispute-management-needs-an-overhaul?utm_medium=rssfinextra&utm_source=finextrafeed",
